      "lid": "191",
      "text": "So the way this works is I'm going to sum over, enumerate over all possible values of all the variables that occur here, which are sequence, hidden, and C2.\n\n"
    },
    {
      "lid": "192",
      "text": "And I'm going to basically index into x, index into y, multiply them and dump them, accumulate them into the result z sub sequence C2. Okay?\n\n"
